{"path":"container/mdspan/extents/rev-prod-of-extents","title":"std::extents<IndexType,Extents...>::rev-prod-of-extents","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::extents&lt;IndexType,Extents...&gt;::</span><i>rev-prod-of-extents</i>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/mdspan/extents/rev-prod-of-extents","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the product of the sizes of extents with index greater than i. The behavior is undefined if i < rank() is false.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*rev-prod-of-extents*/</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> rank_type i <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition only*</span>)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the product of the sizes of extents with index greater than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i</span></code>. The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> rank<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> i\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> an index above which the sizes of corresponding extents will be multiplied together\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> rank<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span>, return the product of <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/mdspan/extents/extent\"><code>extent</code></a><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">(</span>k<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> for all <code>k</code> in range <span><code>[</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span><code>,&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rank<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span><code>)</code></span>, otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/mdspan/extents/fwd-prod-of-extents\"><i><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fwd-prod-of-extents</span></span></i></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> returns the product of extent size in range <span><code>[</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span><code>,&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">i</span><code>)</code></span><br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition-only member function*</span>)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/mdspan","title":"std::mdspan"},{"path":"container/mdspan/extents","title":"std::extents, std::dextents, std::dims"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::extents<IndexType,Extents...>::rev-prod-of-extents","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Returns the product of the sizes of extents with index greater than i."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"i"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If i + 1 < rank() is true, return the product of extent(k) for all k in range [i + 1, rank()), otherwise 1."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"fwd-prod-of-extents","note":"returns the product of extent size in range [ 0 , i)"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":94,"codeBlockCount":0}
